ng-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"阿尔古斯\"><img alt=\"阿尔古斯\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"阿尔古斯\">阿尔古斯</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>1987宇宙漫步</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：309703</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"5\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">追击</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"5\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/大招.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/额外.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/额外.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3097/309703/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“星间追猎秀”特邀演出<br /><br />各位观众，在下周六，将有一位神秘嘉宾为我们带来一场演出。您一定听说过那位“星际猎人”——████小姐！在行星航线上她是最靠谱的保镖，相信每个经过这条航线的人，都或多或少地听说过她的名字。传说她的子弹曾经击穿一颗小行星，那颗行星的碎片成为了她新的子弹。传说即将变为现实，千万不要错过！<br />届时，马戏团将会抽取三名观众与这位“星际猎人”进行互动。门票数量有限，欲购从速。<br /><br />订购电话：███-████<br />没意思的演出！不如马丁内斯的吉他秀！<br />马丁内斯，怎么又是你？没完了！<br /><br />演出坐标：<br />RA: 05h 55m 10.3s        Dec: +07° 24' 25.43\"<br /><br />备注：我们会为幸运观众购买星际保险公司的特殊保险服务，请勿担忧！</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"309703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cb/Belonging-309704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“闪烁星球”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Dazzling Cosmos\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />61<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶夺人眼球的帽子。受访者表示，鲜艳的打扮和演员的表演其实是一种竞争，表演者需要用行动夺回观众的注意。<br />“想想吧，谢幕的时候，观众记住的不是你的枪法，而是你的帽子。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/33/Belonging-309705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">随身零食<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Snack Belt</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />13.3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>马戏团畅销的纪念品之一。受访者对此并不意外，实用而具有特色的产品不会没有市场。值得一提的是，该腰带的售卖版本中，装饰的是可食用的糖球。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-309706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Belonging-309706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">老伙计马靴<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Old Cowboy Boots</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />9.8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者从家乡带来的靴子，意外符合舞台表演的需要。令受访者烦恼的是，这双靴子被确定为舞台表演的道具后，她不得不再买一双靴子以供日常穿着。<br />“我不留神给这位老伙计签了份卖身契。”受访者的语气颇为沮丧。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%98%9F%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%BD%E7%8C%8E%E7%A7%801.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 星间追猎秀1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%98%9F%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%BD%E7%8C%8E%E7%A7%801.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%98%9F%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%BD%E7%8C%8E%E7%A7%801.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%98%9F%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%BD%E7%8C%8E%E7%A7%801.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%98%9F%E9%97%B4%E8%BF%BD%E7%8C%8E%E7%A7%801.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.